ANNOUNCE: tclpdf 1.0 released
=============================

tclpdf is a pure Tcl extension for creating PDF documents: pages and graphics, embedded TrueType fonts subset to the glyphs actually used, JPEG and PNG images, tables, and electronic invoices as ZUGFeRD / Factur-X in PDF/A-3B. Developed by Alexander Schoepe, it requires only Tcl 8.6.11+ and runs under Tcl 9 as well; zlib is a built-in command rather than a package, and Tk is not used.

1.0 is the first release.

Download / Repository: https://fossil.sowaswie.de/tclpdf


